cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "OpenDream-RSI: an open reproduction of Dream-RSI"
message: "If you use this software, please cite the original paper as well."
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/zhengkid/Dream-RSI"
abstract: >-
  An independent open reproduction of the Dream-RSI framework: online
  exploration into a discovery tree, that tree served back as a replay
  simulator, and dreaming-based improvement of the exploration policy in a
  recursive self-improvement loop.
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Dream-RSI: Recursive Self-Improvement through Evolving Worlds"
    year: 2026
    url: "https://www.dream-rsi.com"
